              "at": 1.3
            },
            {
              "phrase": "cord unwinds",
              "highlight": "weight_assembly",
              "at": 2.28
            },
            {
              "phrase": "drives the gears",
              "highlight": "gear_train",
              "at": 5.13
            }
          ],
          "audio": "audio/power_and_gears_01.wav",
          "duration": 6.35,
          "sfx": {
            "prompt": "Soft cord unwinding with a brief wooden drum creak",
            "audio": "audio/power_and_gears_sfx01.mp3",
            "volume": 0.3,
            "delay": 2.5
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Watch two touching gears. Their teeth push against each other. When one turns clockwise, its neighbour turns the opposite way.",
          "highlight": "gear_train",
          "camera": {
            "focus": "gear_train",
            "seconds": 3,
            "pos": [
              0,
              1.6,
              0
            ]
          },
          "audio": "audio/power_and_gears_02.wav",
          "duration": 6.61
        },
        {
          "text": "A large gear driving a smaller gear makes it turn faster. A small gear driving a larger gear makes it turn more slowly. Watch the meshing pairs.",
          "highlight": "gear_train",
          "camera": {
            "focus": "gear_train",
            "seconds": 3,
            "pos": [
              0,
              1.6,
              0
            ]
          },
          "audio": "audio/power_and_gears_03.wav",
          "duration": 7.65
        },
        {
          "text": "A large wheel and a small pinion can share one shaft, so they turn together. These linked wheels and pinions form the gear train.",
          "highlight": "gear_train",
          "camera": {
            "focus": "gear_train",
            "seconds": 3,
            "pos": [
              0,
              1.6,
              0
            ]
          },
          "cues": [
            {
              "phrase": "large wheel",
              "highlight": "gear_train",
              "at": 0.03
            },
            {
              "phrase": "small pinion",
              "highlight": "gear_train",
              "at": 0.89
            },
            {
              "phrase": "one shaft",
              "highlight": "gear_train",
              "at": 1.97
            }
          ],
          "audio": "audio/power_and_gears_04.wav",
          "duration": 6.51
        },
        {
          "text": "The weight powers the gear train, but power alone cannot measure time. The escapement releases motion little by little. We will explore it next.",
